# Trivy ignore file, read automatically by `trivy fs` and `trivy image`
# (CI: .github/workflows/reusable-image-scan.yml).
#
# Prefer fixing: bump the dependency (npm update / Dependabot), rebuild on a
# newer base digest, or remove the package from the image. Ignore only what
# cannot be fixed yet.
#
# Every entry needs, directly above it, a comment with:
#   - why it is acceptable (e.g. code path not reachable, fix not usable yet)
#   - the ticket that tracks removing the entry
# and an expiry date on the entry itself, so it is looked at again:
#
#   # <package>: <why it is not exploitable here>. OP-xxx
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# No wildcards, no package-wide ignores, no entries without a CVE/GHSA id.
